          }
        },
        "body": {
          "type": "_ui-text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Treat House began with a bake sale on the Upper West Side. Our two kids were raising money for athletic equipment for kids in Africa, and people lined up for the rice krispie treats. They raised $300 that day.</p><p>We kept going, with tastings at school and honest feedback from parents and families. The treat you grew up with, made a little more elevated and a lot more personal.</p><p>Giving back has been part of Treat House from the start, and today we are proud to partner with the Andrew McDonough B+ Foundation.</p><p>Built on a childhood favorite, shared to create new memories.</p>"
          }
        }
